{"4750100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FERALPALS", "steam_appid": 4750100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [4752170], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4750100/extras/5339d0b786aafea30d42ab0adb951da1.poster.avif?t=1783687983\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4750100/extras/5339d0b786aafea30d42ab0adb951da1.webm?t=1783687983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4750100/extras/5339d0b786aafea30d42ab0adb951da1.mp4?t=1783687983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is hard to say what year it is now. Our world is long gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity was wiped out by a pathogen traced back to its own creation: the <strong>Friendly Pals</strong>. Created through genetic experiments and gifted with human intelligence, they were designed to serve humanity and help build a better future for us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead, they inherited our world. Now left behind, the Pals mimic the society of their dead creators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>FERALPALS</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chapter-based mascot horror adventure where each chapter pulls you deeper into the mystery of an uncanny world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4750100/extras/77f269fe7251669c19346791dd69c117.poster.avif?t=1783687983\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4750100/extras/77f269fe7251669c19346791dd69c117.webm?t=1783687983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4750100/extras/77f269fe7251669c19346791dd69c117.mp4?t=1783687983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chapter 1</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Dan</strong>, a little guy who receives an unexpected phone call from his childhood friend <strong>Basil</strong>, inviting him to an old forest campsite to reunite with friends from the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the forest hides something beneath it. A forgotten past. Buried secrets. Remnants of a world that should no longer exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And one impossible question: <strong>Is humanity truly extinct?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4750100/extras/1a074e48206216b9ff7fc710a2f3842e.poster.avif?t=1783687983\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4750100/extras/1a074e48206216b9ff7fc710a2f3842e.webm?t=1783687983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4750100/extras/1a074e48206216b9ff7fc710a2f3842e.mp4?t=1783687983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chapter-based story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an episodic horror adventure with self-contained chapters connected by an overarching mystery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the world after humanity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world looks familiar, even ordinary, just like we left it… but something feels off. Discover the unsettling society the Friendly Pals built after humanity’s fall.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Environmental storytelling</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the nightmare behind the experiments, the pathogen, and civilization’s collapse through exploration and hidden details.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Are Friendly Pals friendly?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet strange allies, terrifying enemies, and perhaps something far worse lurking behind them.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4750100/extras/5339d0b786aafea30d42ab0adb951da1.poster.avif?t=1783687983\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4750100/extras/5339d0b786aafea30d42ab0adb951da1.webm?t=1783687983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4750100/extras/5339d0b786aafea30d42ab0adb951da1.mp4?t=1783687983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is hard to say what year it is now. Our world is long gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity was wiped out by a pathogen traced back to its own creation: the <strong>Friendly Pals</strong>. Created through genetic experiments and gifted with human intelligence, they were designed to serve humanity and help build a better future for us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead, they inherited our world. Now left behind, the Pals mimic the society of their dead creators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>FERALPALS</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chapter-based mascot horror adventure where each chapter pulls you deeper into the mystery of an uncanny world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4750100/extras/77f269fe7251669c19346791dd69c117.poster.avif?t=1783687983\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4750100/extras/77f269fe7251669c19346791dd69c117.webm?t=1783687983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4750100/extras/77f269fe7251669c19346791dd69c117.mp4?t=1783687983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chapter 1</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Dan</strong>, a little guy who receives an unexpected phone call from his childhood friend <strong>Basil</strong>, inviting him to an old forest campsite to reunite with friends from the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the forest hides something beneath it. A forgotten past. Buried secrets. Remnants of a world that should no longer exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And one impossible question: <strong>Is humanity truly extinct?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4750100/extras/1a074e48206216b9ff7fc710a2f3842e.poster.avif?t=1783687983\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4750100/extras/1a074e48206216b9ff7fc710a2f3842e.webm?t=1783687983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4750100/extras/1a074e48206216b9ff7fc710a2f3842e.mp4?t=1783687983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chapter-based story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an episodic horror adventure with self-contained chapters connected by an overarching mystery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the world after humanity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world looks familiar, even ordinary, just like we left it… but something feels off. Discover the unsettling society the Friendly Pals built after humanity’s fall.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Environmental storytelling</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the nightmare behind the experiments, the pathogen, and civilization’s collapse through exploration and hidden details.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Are Friendly Pals friendly?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet strange allies, terrifying enemies, and perhaps something far worse lurking behind them.</p>", "short_description": "Feralpals is a chapter-based mascot horror game. Humanity was wiped out by a pathogen linked to Friendly Pals, genetically engineered creatures, granted human-like intelligence to serve mankind’s ambitions. The Pals are now left behind, imitating their creators' society long after humanity vanished.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4750100/7a632e2932d2d303b21621f4fdd64463871d17c5/header.jpg?t=1783687983", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4750100/644f7be7f41f924064ef91bdf08ca1e236423527/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783687983", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4750100/644f7be7f41f924064ef91bdf08ca1e236423527/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783687983", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 3240 CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GForce GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 7 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Windows Compatible Audio Device</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers